<h2>The service</h2>
<p>
Tlociu is a free, personal hobby project for keeping notes about films you
want to watch or have watched. It is provided as-is, with no guarantee of
availability, and may change or shut down at any time.
</p>

<h2>Accounts</h2>
<p>
Accounts are created by the operator; there is no self-service sign-up.
Signing in is handled through your Google account, and you are responsible
for keeping that account secure. You must provide us an accurate email
address so that Google sign-in can match you to your account.
</p>

<h2>Your content</h2>
<p>
The watchlist entries and notes you create remain yours. By saving them here
you give us permission to store and display them back to you, and, for
entries you explicitly mark as public, to display them publicly. You can
edit or delete your entries at any time, and you can have your entire
account and its data deleted by emailing
<a href="mailto:kevin@goess.org">kevin@goess.org</a>.
</p>

<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
<p>You agree not to:</p>
<ul>
